# sshd_config of the range42 Windows templates (copied by finalize.ps1).
# Public-key authentication only. No "Match Group administrators" block : the key of alice
# (an administrator) is read from C:\Users\alice\.ssh\authorized_keys, where cloudbase-init
# writes the Proxmox `sshkeys` value. The default shell (powershell.exe) is set in the
# registry (HKLM\SOFTWARE\OpenSSH\DefaultShell), not here.

Port 22
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no

Subsystem sftp sftp-server.exe
